# FE-Skills Configuration

This repository contains frontend development skills for AI coding agents.

## Skills Path

Configure Cursor Settings → Features → Skills Path and add the `skills` directory relative to this project root.

This enables all `fe-*` skills (code-review, commit, react-dev-stack, tailwindcss, etc.) in Cursor Composer and Agent mode.

## Available Skills

- `fe-code-review` — 系统性代码审查
- `fe-commit` — Commit 提交规范与 Changelog 生成
- `fe-react-dev-stack` — React + TypeScript 脚手架与开发
- `fe-tailwindcss` — TailwindCSS 开发指南
- `fe-fullstack-dev` — Full Stack 全栈开发
- `fe-node-dev-stack` — Node.js 开发栈
- `fe-project-manager` — 项目管理
- `fe-set-ai-base` — AI 工程化配置初始化
- `fe-setup-basic-project-env` — 通用项目环境配置
- `fe-setup-vsc-config-plugin` — VS Code 扩展工程化配置
- `fe-doc-format` — 文档编写规范化
- `sys-port-manager` — 跨平台端口管理
